# Firebase Data Persistence Implementation

## Problem Statement

The application currently stores all data in browser localStorage, which means data is lost when the browser cache is cleared or reset. The user needs a reliable cloud backup solution to prevent data loss. We'll implement Firebase Firestore for persistent cloud storage.

